Hello! Welcome on the Test Server!

Here is a list of some of the novelties brought up by this BETA 1 Version 1.17.0:

- Treechnid and Soft Oak Dungeons;
- Smithmagic system revised;
- Emoticons with the /me command;
- Blocking square problem has been fixed;
- A new automatic server selection system;
- A more detailed list of your character's characteristics.

This list isn't exhaustive. You can find a more detailed one on the forum in the Test Server section. On the top right-hand corner of your screen, next to the options menu, you'll now find a small button which will enable you to submit a problem you come across to the technical support. You can also talk about it on the forum.

